            "title": "Colour",
            "content": "<p>Colour is one of Tanzanite's most captivating characteristics.</p><p>The gemstone is celebrated for its extraordinary spectrum of blue and violet tones, which can range from softer lavender and violet-blue shades to intensely saturated royal blues.</p><p>Fine Tanzanite is particularly admired for rich, vivid colour and strong saturation. Because each gemstone is formed naturally, subtle variations in tone and colour make every Tanzanite distinct.</p>",
            "highlight_text": "It is this remarkable play between blue and violet that gives Tanzanite its unmistakable character.",
            "footer_text": "Pleochroism: Trichroic Optical Splendour",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "show_button_arrow": true,
            "custom_class": ""
          }
        },
